          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "14. Aman was discussing the structure of atom with his classmates. During the discussion, he learnt that an element X has a mass number of 35 and contains 18 neutrons. Based on this information, answer the following questions:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.272,
            0.49,
            0.795,
            0.508
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) How many electrons and protons does element X have?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.51,
            0.55,
            0.527
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) What is its atomic number?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.262,
            0.529,
            0.507,
            0.546
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) Identify the element X."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.262,
            0.548,
            0.604,
            0.565
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) Write its electronic configuration."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.567,
            0.68,
            0.584
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(v) How many valence electrons does it have?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.262,
            0.586,
            0.888,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(vi) What will be the mass number if two neutrons are added to its nucleus?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.256,
            0.622,
            0.746,
            0.64
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(vii) What will be the relation of X with the new atom?"
